      "writtenOn": "2022-11-29T19:23:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why not add this to the release-specific branch, why does this have to be for `android-mainline` at this point in time?",
      "revId": "6ae3ca00776f718381b2f1497e0767a3d015cd2d",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "65533962_f4bfa525",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1934715
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-11-29T19:27:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I wanted to add this to `android-mainline` so that it doesn\u0027t have to keep getting cherry-picked into release branches as they get created, potentially causing this to be missed.",
      "parentUuid": "6428978f_03e936ac",
      "revId": "6ae3ca00776f718381b2f1497e0767a3d015cd2d",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "d9849cad_d9ba7895",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1125653
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-11-30T10:14:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That adds to our maintenance burden over time as we then need to deal with conflicts for all future upstream changes.  Just apply one-off changes like this to the specific branch you need it to go to please.",
      "parentUuid": "65533962_f4bfa525",
      "revId": "6ae3ca00776f718381b2f1497e0767a3d015cd2d",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "3b3057da_9877786c",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1934715
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-11-30T18:52:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "By conflicts, do you mean merge conflicts for this file (`arch/arm64/mm/dma-mapping.c`) and `arch/arm64/include/asm/cache.h`?\n\nIf so, both this change and the subsequent change are small in scope, and shouldn\u0027t result in conflicts that are difficult to resolve.",
      "parentUuid": "d9849cad_d9ba7895",
      "revId": "6ae3ca00776f718381b2f1497e0767a3d015cd2d",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "f27a25cf_275b5963",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1125653
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-12-01T07:35:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\"difficult\" is easy to say when someone else has to do the resolutions 😊\n\nThere is also the tracking of this change in the patch queue repo that will happen, any additional patch added that is not upstream adds to our overall workload, please be aware of that and only add things that are absolutely required.\n\nAnyway, as this is not needed in this branch at this time, please wait until the release-specific branch is made and then it can be merged there.  But to add this to `android-mainline` at this point in time does not seem to be required at all.",
      "parentUuid": "3b3057da_9877786c",
      "revId": "6ae3ca00776f718381b2f1497e0767a3d015cd2d",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "75192c64_89c7453e",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1934715
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-12-01T18:36:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "These patches are not going to be applied to just one or two branches. For example, these patches will need to be applied to the `android14-x.y` branches, and then each time a new branch is created from android-mainline (e.g. `android15-x.y` and so on) until the upstream solution lands. So, it\u0027s not just a one-off set of patches, which is why I think this should go on android-mainline to avoid having to keep applying these patches every time a branch is created.",
      "parentUuid": "f27a25cf_275b5963",
      "revId": "6ae3ca00776f718381b2f1497e0767a3d015cd2d",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "3d6f39e3_6f59cee4",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1125653
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-12-02T08:37:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For `android15-X` this should all be resolved upstream properly and we should not need this hack.  So just apply this to the `android14-X` branches now, that\u0027s all that should be needed.",
      "parentUuid": "75192c64_89c7453e",
      "revId": "6ae3ca00776f718381b2f1497e0767a3d015cd2d",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    }
